  "details": "Please add *.vimeocdn.com to the Video Allow List.\n\nWhen attempting to play a Vimeo video, it was blocked.\n\nI specified the video URL obtained from the Vimeo management page in \"UdonSyncPlayer (Unity)\".\n\nThe URL looks like the following:\n\nhttps://player.vimeo.com/progressive_redirect/****\n\nIt appears that Vimeo redirects the request, which results in the URL changing to \"download-video-ak.vimeocdn.com\". Because this URL is not included in the Video Allow List, the video seems to be blocked.\n\n[Log ---->]\n\n[Video Playback] Attempting to resolve URL 'https://player.vimeo.com/progressive_redirect/***\n\n.....\n\n[Video Playback] ERROR: Disallowed URL:  'https://download-video-ak.vimeocdn.com/v3-1/***\n\n[Log <----]",
